{"data":{"results":[{"id":"427638bd-35c2-4592-bee3-7a33d0883d8a","name":"Toxic Events","description":"Stay in the loop with the hottest events in DCL! From Dogebusters madness, Toxic Tuesday chaos to W.T.F DCL vibes and community spotlights.. we’ve got it all💜","ownerAddress":"0x6723dcb07f3ca735223cd1c0acfa62dd994a1bb4","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":626,"ownerName":"ToxicWaifu","voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"2b55a598-07cd-408e-a541-7407fffc4ebc","name":"Last Slice Creators","description":"We’re building a game from scratch on the largest Decentraland scene ever... 3,249 parcels on a 57x57 World! Join us every Thursday: Hour 1 features live building of game mechanics and the world, Hour 2 is open office hours for anyone wanting help creating their own Decentraland game.\n\nA 6-month buildathon, hackathon, free coding help, open sourced project building, giveaways, bounties, and so much more. \r\n\r\nSpectate and earn. Bounty and earn. Build and earn.  Play and earn. ","ownerAddress":"0xaabe0ecfaf9e028d63cf7ea7e772cf52d662691a","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":180,"ownerName":"Lastraum","voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"9ba90937-0ecd-4017-9240-0d41dbb8f2ce","name":"Meta GamiMall Play & Earn","description":"Welcome to our community—a hub for Web3 enthusiasts seeking both fun and earning opportunities. We will base in one of the most active scene in Decentraland, MetaGamiMall. And we share the latest trends, connect through discussions, and enjoy activities like wearable giveaway etc. Our goal is to blend insight, entertainment, and opportunity so members always leave with value.","ownerAddress":"0x797066a17f83425c1b4c7a8cca52d19095520a52","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":296,"ownerName":"MetaDoge","voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"eb8a4496-d08d-40af-85b9-5ca5cdca156c","name":"Old Guy BBQ","description":"The smoky heart of the metaverse where flavor meets friendship! Hang out with fellow barbecue lovers around a glowing virtual firepit, swap laughs, and perfect your digital ribs. Grab your apron (or NFT spatula), crack a beer, and join Old Guys BBQ — where the smoke never fades, the parties get wilder, and every event tastes like victory.","ownerAddress":"0xdb760099f0f3359131e08716848f23c014d35b9e","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":223,"ownerName":"oldguy","voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"1c71f864-fee9-4a67-947c-7954382fdf89","name":"Mug Club","description":"Mug Club is an onchain social club founded on Base in 2024 by juxton, the creator of Franky’s Tavern, Decentraland’s longest-running interactive bar.\n\nEach mug is your membership pass, unlocking access to the club and experiences across Decentraland and beyond.\n\nGrab a mug and join the club.\n\nMore information: https://mugclub.wtf","ownerAddress":"0xd4f20b86ab05e5e91cecfefe874657b0f7bfc87d","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":235,"ownerName":"juxton","voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}}],"total":143,"page":2,"pages":29,"limit":5}}